Game
----
Idle Skilling is made by Lavaflame2, who owns the game and its art. This is an unofficial fan tool, not
affiliated with or endorsed by the developer. Formulas, tables and rules were derived from the game for
compatibility. No game art and no extracted game code are included. The developer was told about this
project and its publication in October 2026.

